<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00325">
	<title>Automatic heating and air conditioning (A/C) operation</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>automatic climate control system
					<indexterm>automatic heating and air conditioning (A/C) operation</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02058">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02059">
								<image href="images/KIA_C00_047.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ol id="e02060">
			<li>
				<p>Tap the <term translate="no">AUTO</term> icon.</p>
				<p>The modes, fan speeds, air intake, and air-conditioning are controlled automatically by setting the temperature.</p>
				<table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="e02061">
					<tgroup cols="4" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
						<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="0.461*"/>
						<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="0.658*"/>
						<colspec colnum="3" colname="col3" colwidth="0.695*"/>
						<colspec colnum="4" colname="col4" colwidth="0.430*"/>
						<thead>
							<row rowsep="1">
								<entry colname="col1">
									<p>Level</p>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col2">
									<p>Indicator</p>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col3">
									<p>LCD Display</p>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col4">
									<p>Air flow</p>
								</entry>
							</row>
						</thead>
						<tbody>
							<row rowsep="1">
								<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
									<p>High</p>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
									<fig id="e02062">
										<image href="images/N_TK25C159.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break" outputclass="nolabel"/>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col3" align="center" valign="middle">
									<fig id="e02063">
										<image href="images/N_CT25C187.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break" outputclass="nolabel"/>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col4" align="center" valign="middle">
									<p>2–8</p>
								</entry>
							</row>
							<row rowsep="1">
								<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
									<p>Medium</p>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
									<fig id="e02064">
										<image href="images/N_TK25C158.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break" outputclass="nolabel"/>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col3" align="center" valign="middle">
									<fig id="e02065">
										<image href="images/N_CT25C186.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break" outputclass="nolabel"/>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col4" align="center" valign="middle">
									<p>1–6</p>
								</entry>
							</row>
							<row rowsep="0">
								<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
									<p>Low</p>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
									<fig id="e02066">
										<image href="images/N_TK25C157.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break" outputclass="nolabel"/>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col3" align="center" valign="middle">
									<fig id="e02067">
										<image href="images/N_CT25C185.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break" outputclass="nolabel"/>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry colname="col4" align="center" valign="middle">
									<p>1–5</p>
								</entry>
							</row>
						</tbody>
					</tgroup>
				</table>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Press the temperature control lever to the desired temperature.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<note type="tip" id="e02068">
			<ul id="e02069">
				<li>
					<p>To turn the automatic operation off, press any of the following buttons:</p>
					<ul id="e02070">
						<li>
							<p>Mode selection lever/icon</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Air conditioning icon</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Front windshield defroster icon</p>
							<p>Press the icon again to deselect the front windshield defroster function. The <term translate="no">AUTO</term> sign will appear on the information display once again.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Fan speed control lever</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p>The selected function is controlled manually, while other functions operate automatically.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>To improve the effectiveness of the climate control, press the <term translate="no">AUTO</term> icon and set the temperature to 22 °C (72 °F).</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
		<note type="tip" id="e02071">
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02072">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e02073">
									<image href="images/N_SP327_B05_007_1.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>For better control of the heating and cooling system, never place anything over the sensor (1) located on the instrument panel.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00324.dita#t00324" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Automatic climate control system</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>